# Raw media is never read by Claude sessions directly. Agents work from the
# JSON checkpoints and contact sheets (sheets/*.png) under .llmve/ instead.
# NOTE: Claude Code enforces this through the Read() deny rules in
# .claude/settings.json; this file documents the same boundary for other tools.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.avi
*.m4v
*.webm
*.mxf
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.flac
